"missions and item packs.\n"
"\n"
"~To enjoy these contents, you must have a\n"
"broadband connection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4078\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Go head-to-head with another player in Nine-ball,\n"
"Rotation, and Eight-ball.\n"
"This mode allows for up to 2 input devices.\n"
"Results achieved in this game mode will not count\n"
"towards completion or achievements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Go head-to-head with another player in 301,\n"
"Cricket, and Count-Up.\n"
"This mode allows for up to 2 input devices.\n"
"Results achieved in this game mode will not count\n"
"towards completion or achievements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4481\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Enjoy a two-player versus mode for\n"
"Answer x Answer. This requires two input devices\n"
"as both players play at the same time.\n"
"\n"
"Your results achieved in this game mode will not count\n"
"towards completion or achievements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4697\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Go head-to-head with another player in a 3 or 10\n"
"frame game of bowling.\n"
"This mode allows for up to 2 input devices.\n"
"Results achieved in this game mode will not count\n"
"towards completion or achievements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4899\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Go head-to-head with another player in competition\n"
"mode. This mode allows for up to 2 input devices.\n"
"Results achieved in this game mode will\n"
"not count towards completion or achievements."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5108\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Take out the Final Boss!-\n"
"\n"
"Start at Level 1 with zero skills and take to the streets of Kamurocho, "
"battling your way through random encounters to get to the Final Boss. The "
"money and experience points you earn by the end of the mission will "
"translate into prize money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5390\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Escape your Pursuers and Complete Missions!-\n"
"\n"
"Take to the nighttime streets of Kamurocho for a very special game with "
"very simple rules: complete 10 missions without getting caught by any "
"pursuers!\n"
"\n"
"If one catches you, it's game over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5635\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"A Boss Character Dream Matchup!-\n"
"\n"
"An all-star tournament that consists of hard-hitting matches between the "
"game's main characters set at the Coliseum!\n"
"\n"
"Who will prove to be the toughest of them all!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5845\tMAIN_EXP"
msgid ""
"Eliminate Opposing Teams Using the Ultimate\n"
"　　　　Tag Combo of Kiryu and Majima!-\n"
"\n"
"A dream tag match using Kiryu and Majima at the Coliseum! Teams are formed "
"of an all-star cast, creating the toughest tag teams you won't see anywhere "
"else. Who will prevail as the strongest tag team!?"
msgstr ""

