msgctxt "8418\tMAIN_EXP2"
msgid ""
"How to update:\n"
"\n"
"If Extra Modes are being distributed, updates\n"
"will be made automatically when booting Yakuza 3\n"
"as long as you are using a {PS4} connected to the\n"
"Internet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8597\tMAIN_EXP2"
msgid ""
"In addition to the Final Boss, there are eight other boss characters "
"wandering about Kamurocho. Accumulate experience points and gain levels by "
"beating opponents and bosses!\n"
"\n"
"Complete the mission by taking out the Final Boss. The money and experience "
"points you earn by the end of the mission will translate into prize money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8924\tMAIN_EXP2"
msgid ""
"Each mission must be completed within the 3-minute time limit, or you will "
"lose the game.\n"
"\n"
"Complete all 10 missions to beat the game. The faster you complete each "
"mission, the better. You will receive a reward based on how many missions "
"you completed and how fast they were completed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9210\tMAIN_EXP2"
msgid ""
"In this tournament, you will only be as strong as you currently are, so "
"you'll have a hard time achieving victory if you're at a low level!\n"
"\n"
"Only the money you earn in this tournament will be carried over outside the "
"minigame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9438\tMAIN_EXP2"
msgid ""
"In this tournament, you will only be as strong as you currently are,  so "
"don't hold Majima back with a low-level Kiryu!\n"
"\n"
"Only the money you earn in this tournament will be carried over outside the "
"minigame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9737\tMAIN_EXP3"
msgid ""
"If your update fails due to reasons such as\n"
"disconnecting during an update, perform a manual\n"
"update from the Extras menu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9866\tMAIN_EXP3"
msgid ""
"After beating a regular boss, you will be given the choice to quit the "
"mission. If you choose to do so, you will receive prize money based on your "
"performance up to that point.\n"
"\n"
"Be aware that you can only keep the money earned in this mode, not levels "
"or experience! Think you have what it takes for this challenge?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10183\tMAIN_EXP3"
msgid ""
"Confident in your fighting skills? Think you're a good runner? There are "
"boatloads of cash waiting for you in Survival Tag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10307\tMAIN_EXP3"
